{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find object, approach, take, check properties, do specific task in order to return to base safely. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = isObjectBig    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectDestination    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ReturnObjectToBase    /> <Action ID = GoToNewLocation    />",
